                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7009c470-b782-463f-b041-3657a0ff50d9",
                                "sense_id": "e630f859-ee5c-3a55-8d86-fd8c62c621e3",
                                "text": "Everything I've tried since pa died has gone flooey."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed015e70-2a83-418b-8580-9e3eaf97dfc4",
                                "sense_id": "e630f859-ee5c-3a55-8d86-fd8c62c621e3",
                                "text": "Well, sir, about a second after Jake nodded his head, the place went flooey. Everybody started whoopin' and placin' bets and yelling out drink orders […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "519d2063-c90b-4647-9d05-507c9284781f",
                                "sense_id": "e630f859-ee5c-3a55-8d86-fd8c62c621e3",
                                "text": "\"Of course. No matter how many times we run the math, there's still a chance this could all go flooey.\"\n\"‘Flooey’?\"\n\"Flooey,\" agreed Mr. Bones. \"There might be something we haven't thought of, some X-factor that makes it all go wrong.\""
                            }
                        ]
